    "updated_at": "2026-02-20T17:06:08Z",
    "body": "I was prototyping a navigational overhaul to a large web app in the hopes of using View Transitions and pretty miffed we can't adopt it for this reason – we have a large iOS user base, and as it stands, swiping back in Safari with View Transitions and getting the 'double animation' feels like a bug.\n\nDoes commenting/posting anywhere else help to move this along (and apologies this isn't moving this discussion further along)?",
